cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Manifold-based Dynamic Memory (MDM): extractive recall over a message archive"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - name: "The Manifold-based Dynamic Memory authors"
keywords:
  - information retrieval
  - long-term memory
  - model context protocol
  - TF-IDF
  - manifold learning
abstract: >-
  Extractive recall over a personal message archive: keyword queries return a
  short, ordered, de-duplicated passage with provenance pointers, with honest
  refusal when no relevant memory exists, and an MCP server exposing recall,
  remember and stats. The shipped index is a lexical baseline; the
  manifold-based representation is the research target.
